      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\n<div class=\"august-issue-banner\">\n    <div class=\"august-banner-badge\">🔔 14 Official Languages Edition — Part 2</div>\n    <div class=\"august-banner-content\">\n        <h4>Vol. 2026 — Master Editorial Hub (Part 2)</h4>\n        <p>Welcome to Part 2 of our master editorial hub for beginner language learners (CEFR A0–A1). In this edition, we explore action, perception, modality, dwelling, and Q&A verb clusters across all 14 official languages!</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1.5rem; background: #f0f9ff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #bae6fd;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#0284c7;\">🌐 14 Official Languages Navigation Hub (Part 2)</h3>\n    <p style=\"color:#334155; margin-bottom:1.25rem;\">Select any target language below to explore its deep-dive Part 2 guide with rich phrase examples and usages:</p>\n    \n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem;\">\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-en.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇧 English Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-fr.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇫🇷 French Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-it.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇮🇹 Italian Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-ru.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇷🇺 Russian Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-el.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇷 Greek Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-tt.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Tatar Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-ba.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Bashkir Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-br.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Breton Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-pt.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇵🇹 Portuguese Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-es.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇪🇸 Spanish Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-de.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇩🇪 German Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-hy.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇦🇲 Armenian Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-ka.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇪 Georgian Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-cv.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Chuvash Guide (Pt. 2) ↗</a>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"verb-map-container\">\n    <h3 class=\"verb-map-title\">🗺️ The 10 Essential Core Verbs (Part 2 Focus)</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:1rem; color:#334155;\">These 10 essential action & perception anchors power everyday speech across all 14 official languages:</p>\n\n    <div class=\"verb-map-grid\">\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>1. Do / Make</strong> — Activities, homework vs creation.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>2. Speak / Talk / Say / Tell</strong> — Communication, speaking, storytelling.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>3. Look / Watch / See</strong> — Visual perception and attention.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>4. Listen / Hear</strong> — Active listening vs hearing sounds.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>5. Must / Have to</strong> — Necessity, obligations, duties.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>6. Take / Give / Get</strong> — Exchange, obtaining, receiving.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>7. Live</strong> — Dwelling, location, lifestyle.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>8. Wait</strong> — Patience, waiting for transport/time.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>9. Understand</strong> — Comprehension, active listening.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>10. Ask / Answer</strong> — Questions, answers, requests.</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n"
